	(text "Antenna evaluation kit, board dn024_common.\n\nAntenna: DN024 / SWRA227E, 868 + 2440 MHz, an exact copy of the note's\nown dimension table, checked by its verify_against_* script.\n\nGround plane: 45 x 60 mm, the kit's common plane, shared by all three antennas so the\nthree boards can be compared with each other. On this plane none\nof them reproduces its published numbers, and that is the point.\n\nMatching: Z1=DNP  Z2=3.9pF  Z3=DNP\nSWRA227E Table 3, dual band, on the 43 x 63 mm plane it was measured on. Z1/Z2/Z3 are the note's Z61/Z62/Z63.\n\n2.95 mm wide 50 ohm microstrip on 1.6 mm FR4 (er 4.5),\nthe same on all six boards so the launch is not a variable.\n\nBefore simulating or running DRC: fill the zones (B in the PCB\neditor). KiCad stores them unfilled and a plane is half the antenna."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 112 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "23149ac3-1dd6-57f6-a81d-49ee90910c3e")
	)
